English:
definition Iso
  signature: : X × X -> X × X -> Prop
  body: Relation.EqvGen fun (x, xsy) (xiy, y) => IsMaximal x xsy ∧ xsy = x ⊔ y ∧ xiy = x ⊓ y

中文:
定义 同构
  签名: : X × X -> X × X -> 命题
  定义体: Relation.EqvGen fun (x, xsy) (xiy, y) => IsMaximal x xsy ∧ xsy = x ⊔ y ∧ xiy = x ⊓ y

Depends on / 依赖: EqvGen, IsMaximal, Relation, Relation.EqvGen
-/
def Iso : X × X -> X × X -> Prop :=
  Relation.EqvGen fun (x, xsy) (xiy, y) => IsMaximal x xsy ∧ xsy = x ⊔ y ∧ xiy = x ⊓ y

