theorem `second_iso` / 定理 `second_iso`

English:
theorem second_iso
  given: {x y : X} (h : IsMaximal x (x ⊔ y))
  statement: Iso (x, x ⊔ y) (x ⊓ y, y)
  proof: Relation.EqvGen.rel (x, x ⊔ y) (x ⊓ y, y) ⟨h, rfl, rfl⟩

