English:
theorem isMaximal_inf_right_of_isMaximal_sup
  statement: {x y : X} (hxz : IsMaximal x (x ⊔ y))
  proof: by
  rw [inf_comm]
  rw [sup_comm] at hxz hyz
  exact isMaximal_inf_left_of_isMaximal_sup hyz hxz

中文:
定理 isMaximal_inf_right_of_isMaximal_sup
  结论: {x y : X} (hxz : 是极大 x (x ⊔ y))
